Benchmark graphs in tools/layout-bench/models6.js were converted from published sources that remain under their own
terms: the Rome graphs (graphdrawing.org) and the ontologies FOAF, Dublin Core terms, OWL-Time, DCAT 3, BFO 2020,
DOLCE+DnS Ultralite, SAREF core, GoodRelations and the Cell Ontology. Open-source layout engines used for comparison
(Graphviz, ELK, WebCola, d3-force, dagre, Cytoscape and its extensions) are loaded from public CDNs or run as separate
programs; none is redistributed here.
